---
import CodeBlock from '../CodeBlock.astro';
import Callout from '../Callout.astro';
import DocSection from '../DocSection.astro';
import DocImage from '../DocImage.astro';
import DocList from '../DocList.astro';
---

<article class="doc-article">
  <h1 class="doc-article__title">Google A2A Protocol</h1>

  <p class="doc-article__intro">
    Guía del protocolo Agent-to-Agent (A2A) de Google para comunicación
    estandarizada entre agentes de IA. Cubre la especificación del protocolo,
    Agent Cards, gestión de tareas, streaming y autenticación.
  </p>

  <!-- Protocol Overview -->
  <section id="protocol-overview">
    <h2 class="doc-article__h2">Protocol Overview</h2>
    <p>
      A2A define un estándar abierto para que agentes de IA se <strong>descubran</strong>,
      <strong>comuniquen</strong> y <strong>colaboren</strong> independientemente de su
      framework o proveedor. Se basa en HTTP/JSON-RPC.
    </p>

    <CodeBlock lang="text">
      <Fragment set:html={`<span class="token-comment">Flujo de comunicación A2A</span>

┌──────────────┐                              ┌──────────────┐
│  <span class="token-func">Agent A</span>     │                              │  <span class="token-func">Agent B</span>     │
│  (client)    │                              │  (server)    │
│              │                              │              │
│  1. Discover │   GET /.well-known/agent.json│              │
│  ────────────┼─────────────────────────────▶│              │
│              │◀─────────────────────────────┤  Agent Card  │
│              │            200 OK            │              │
│              │                              │              │
│  2. Send Task│   POST / (JSON-RPC)          │              │
│  ────────────┼─────────────────────────────▶│              │
│              │   method: "tasks/send"       │  3. Process  │
│              │                              │  ────────────│
│              │                              │  Execute task│
│              │◀─────────────────────────────┤              │
│  4. Result   │   JSON-RPC Response          │              │
│              │   (Task with artifacts)      │              │
└──────────────┘                              └──────────────┘`} />
    </CodeBlock>

    <div class="doc-table-wrapper custom-scroll">
      <table class="doc-table">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Concepto</th><th>Descripción</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><strong>Agent Card</strong></td><td>Documento JSON que describe las capacidades del agente, sus skills y cómo autenticarse</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Task</strong></td><td>Unidad de trabajo enviada entre agentes con un ciclo de vida definido</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Message</strong></td><td>Comunicación dentro de una task con uno o más Parts</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Part</strong></td><td>Contenido atómico: TextPart, FilePart o DataPart</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Artifact</strong></td><td>Resultado producido por el agente al completar una task</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Agent Card -->
  <section id="agent-card">
    <h2 class="doc-article__h2">Agent Card</h2>
    <p>
      La <strong>Agent Card</strong> es un documento JSON servido en
      <code class="doc-inline-code">/.well-known/agent.json</code> que describe las capacidades
      del agente. Es el mecanismo de descubrimiento del protocolo.
    </p>

    <CodeBlock lang="json">
      <Fragment set:html={`{
  <span class="token-keyword">"name"</span>: <span class="token-string">"CodeReview Agent"</span>,
  <span class="token-keyword">"description"</span>: <span class="token-string">"Agente que revisa código, sugiere mejoras y detecta bugs"</span>,
  <span class="token-keyword">"url"</span>: <span class="token-string">"https://agent.example.com/"</span>,
  <span class="token-keyword">"version"</span>: <span class="token-string">"1.0.0"</span>,
  <span class="token-keyword">"capabilities"</span>: {
    <span class="token-keyword">"streaming"</span>: <span class="token-string">true</span>,
    <span class="token-keyword">"pushNotifications"</span>: <span class="token-string">false</span>
  },
  <span class="token-keyword">"skills"</span>: [
    {
      <span class="token-keyword">"id"</span>: <span class="token-string">"code-review"</span>,
      <span class="token-keyword">"name"</span>: <span class="token-string">"Code Review"</span>,
      <span class="token-keyword">"description"</span>: <span class="token-string">"Analiza código fuente y genera sugerencias"</span>,
      <span class="token-keyword">"tags"</span>: [<span class="token-string">"python"</span>, <span class="token-string">"javascript"</span>, <span class="token-string">"review"</span>],
      <span class="token-keyword">"examples"</span>: [
        <span class="token-string">"Revisa este pull request para bugs de seguridad"</span>,
        <span class="token-string">"Sugiere mejoras de rendimiento en este código"</span>
      ]
    },
    {
      <span class="token-keyword">"id"</span>: <span class="token-string">"bug-detection"</span>,
      <span class="token-keyword">"name"</span>: <span class="token-string">"Bug Detection"</span>,
      <span class="token-keyword">"description"</span>: <span class="token-string">"Detecta bugs potenciales en el código"</span>,
      <span class="token-keyword">"tags"</span>: [<span class="token-string">"bugs"</span>, <span class="token-string">"testing"</span>]
    }
  ],
  <span class="token-keyword">"authentication"</span>: {
    <span class="token-keyword">"schemes"</span>: [<span class="token-string">"Bearer"</span>],
    <span class="token-keyword">"credentials"</span>: <span class="token-string">"OAuth2 token required"</span>
  }
}`} />
    </CodeBlock>
  </section>

  <!-- Task Management -->
  <section id="task-management">
    <h2 class="doc-article__h2">Task Management</h2>
    <p>
      Las tareas tienen un ciclo de vida definido con estados claros.
      Se envían via JSON-RPC y pueden ser síncronas o asíncronas.
    </p>

    <CodeBlock lang="text">
      <Fragment set:html={`<span class="token-comment">Ciclo de vida de una Task</span>

 ┌───────────┐     ┌──────────┐     ┌───────────┐
 │ <span class="token-string">submitted</span> │────▶│ <span class="token-string">working</span>  │────▶│ <span class="token-string">completed</span> │
 └───────────┘     └────┬─────┘     └───────────┘
                        │
                   ┌────▼──────┐
                   │  <span class="token-string">failed</span>   │
                   └───────────┘
                        │
                   ┌────▼────────────┐
                   │ <span class="token-string">input-required</span>  │  <span class="token-comment">(necesita más info del client)</span>
                   └─────────────────┘`} />
    </CodeBlock>

    <h3 class="doc-article__h3">Enviar una task (client)</h3>
    <CodeBlock lang="python">
      <Fragment set:html={`<span class="token-keyword">import</span> httpx

<span class="token-comment"># ── Enviar task al agente A2A ──</span>
request = {
    <span class="token-string">"jsonrpc"</span>: <span class="token-string">"2.0"</span>,
    <span class="token-string">"id"</span>: <span class="token-string">"req-001"</span>,
    <span class="token-string">"method"</span>: <span class="token-string">"tasks/send"</span>,
    <span class="token-string">"params"</span>: {
        <span class="token-string">"id"</span>: <span class="token-string">"task-123"</span>,
        <span class="token-string">"message"</span>: {
            <span class="token-string">"role"</span>: <span class="token-string">"user"</span>,
            <span class="token-string">"parts"</span>: [
                {
                    <span class="token-string">"type"</span>: <span class="token-string">"text"</span>,
                    <span class="token-string">"text"</span>: <span class="token-string">"Revisa este código Python para bugs de seguridad"</span>
                },
                {
                    <span class="token-string">"type"</span>: <span class="token-string">"file"</span>,
                    <span class="token-string">"file"</span>: {
                        <span class="token-string">"name"</span>: <span class="token-string">"auth.py"</span>,
                        <span class="token-string">"mimeType"</span>: <span class="token-string">"text/x-python"</span>,
                        <span class="token-string">"bytes"</span>: <span class="token-string">"base64-encoded-content..."</span>
                    }
                }
            ]
        }
    }
}

response = httpx.<span class="token-func">post</span>(<span class="token-string">"https://agent.example.com/"</span>, json=request)
result = response.<span class="token-func">json</span>()`} />
    </CodeBlock>
  </section>

  <!-- Server Implementation -->
  <section id="server-implementation">
    <h2 class="doc-article__h2">Server Implementation</h2>
    <p>
      Implementar un servidor A2A con el SDK oficial de Google. El servidor
      registra handlers para cada método del protocolo.
    </p>

    <CodeBlock lang="python">
      <Fragment set:html={`<span class="token-keyword">from</span> a2a.server <span class="token-keyword">import</span> A2AServer, TaskHandler
<span class="token-keyword">from</span> a2a.types <span class="token-keyword">import</span> (
    AgentCard, Skill, Task, TaskState,
    Message, TextPart, Artifact,
)

<span class="token-comment"># ── Agent Card ──</span>
card = <span class="token-func">AgentCard</span>(
    name=<span class="token-string">"CodeReview Agent"</span>,
    description=<span class="token-string">"Revisa código y detecta bugs"</span>,
    url=<span class="token-string">"https://agent.example.com/"</span>,
    version=<span class="token-string">"1.0.0"</span>,
    skills=[
        <span class="token-func">Skill</span>(
            id=<span class="token-string">"code-review"</span>,
            name=<span class="token-string">"Code Review"</span>,
            description=<span class="token-string">"Analiza código fuente"</span>,
        )
    ],
)

<span class="token-comment"># ── Task Handler ──</span>
<span class="token-keyword">class</span> <span class="token-func">ReviewHandler</span>(TaskHandler):
    <span class="token-keyword">async def</span> <span class="token-func">on_task_send</span>(<span class="token-keyword">self</span>, task: Task) -> Task:
        <span class="token-comment"># Extraer código del mensaje</span>
        user_message = task.messages[-<span class="token-string">1</span>]
        code = <span class="token-keyword">self</span>.<span class="token-func">extract_code</span>(user_message)

        <span class="token-comment"># Ejecutar review con LLM</span>
        review = <span class="token-keyword">await self</span>.<span class="token-func">run_review</span>(code)

        <span class="token-comment"># Devolver resultado como artifact</span>
        task.status = TaskState.COMPLETED
        task.artifacts = [
            <span class="token-func">Artifact</span>(
                name=<span class="token-string">"review-result"</span>,
                parts=[<span class="token-func">TextPart</span>(text=review)],
            )
        ]
        <span class="token-keyword">return</span> task

<span class="token-comment"># ── Iniciar servidor ──</span>
server = <span class="token-func">A2AServer</span>(agent_card=card, handler=<span class="token-func">ReviewHandler</span>())
server.<span class="token-func">run</span>(host=<span class="token-string">"0.0.0.0"</span>, port=<span class="token-string">8080</span>)`} />
    </CodeBlock>
  </section>

  <!-- Streaming -->
  <section id="streaming">
    <h2 class="doc-article__h2">Streaming</h2>
    <p>
      Para tareas de larga duración, A2A soporta <strong>Server-Sent Events (SSE)</strong>
      que permiten al client recibir actualizaciones en tiempo real.
    </p>

    <CodeBlock lang="python">
      <Fragment set:html={`<span class="token-comment"># Client: Recibir streaming via SSE</span>
<span class="token-keyword">import</span> httpx

request = {
    <span class="token-string">"jsonrpc"</span>: <span class="token-string">"2.0"</span>,
    <span class="token-string">"id"</span>: <span class="token-string">"req-002"</span>,
    <span class="token-string">"method"</span>: <span class="token-string">"tasks/sendSubscribe"</span>,  <span class="token-comment"># SSE endpoint</span>
    <span class="token-string">"params"</span>: {
        <span class="token-string">"id"</span>: <span class="token-string">"task-456"</span>,
        <span class="token-string">"message"</span>: {
            <span class="token-string">"role"</span>: <span class="token-string">"user"</span>,
            <span class="token-string">"parts"</span>: [{<span class="token-string">"type"</span>: <span class="token-string">"text"</span>, <span class="token-string">"text"</span>: <span class="token-string">"Analiza este repo completo"</span>}]
        }
    }
}

<span class="token-comment"># Stream de eventos</span>
<span class="token-keyword">with</span> httpx.<span class="token-func">stream</span>(<span class="token-string">"POST"</span>, <span class="token-string">"https://agent.example.com/"</span>, json=request) <span class="token-keyword">as</span> r:
    <span class="token-keyword">for</span> line <span class="token-keyword">in</span> r.<span class="token-func">iter_lines</span>():
        <span class="token-keyword">if</span> line.startswith(<span class="token-string">"data:"</span>):
            event = json.<span class="token-func">loads</span>(line[<span class="token-string">5:</span>])
            <span class="token-func">print</span>(f<span class="token-string">"Status: {event['result']['status']}"</span>)
            <span class="token-comment"># submitted → working → completed</span>`} />
    </CodeBlock>

    <Callout type="info" title="Multi-agent orchestration">
      Un agente <strong>orquestador</strong> puede descubrir otros agentes vía Agent Cards,
      enviar sub-tareas a agentes especializados (code review, testing, deployment),
      y combinar los resultados. A2A estandariza esta comunicación.
    </Callout>
  </section>

  <!-- PLACEHOLDER -->
</article>
